            <WeaponTraitFiddler_WeaponUpgrade_CustomGrip>1</WeaponTraitFiddler_WeaponUpgrade_CustomGrip>
            <WeaponTraitFiddler_WeaponUpgrade_ExtendedBarrel>1</WeaponTraitFiddler_WeaponUpgrade_ExtendedBarrel>
